100 0 obj
  << /ActualText (My mother died\056\n\nShe had chemotherapy and caught pneumonia\054 and kidney failure\056\n\nThey gave her antibiotics and told me she would recover\056 Then they would continue the\ntreatment\056\n\nShe told me something else\054 but I didn\031t listen\056\n\nI wasn\031t at all prepared\056 I had not told her the words I would\031ve told her if I knew she was\nleaving\056 In fact the last thing I said to her was blaming her for not fighting\054 trying to lecture\nher\056\n\nI found her dead and felt deceived\056\n\nShe was only 73 years old\056\n\nShe knew I loved her\054 I know she loved me\056 But still\056\n\nAlways reflect on the possibility of death\056\n\nDaniel Wirg\345rd www\056wirgard\056com daniel\056wirgard\100gmail\056com)
     /K [ 0 ]
